    "detailed_description": "&quot;Clandestine: The Hidden Truth&quot; a psychological horror adventure that blurs the lines between reality and nightmare.<br><br><strong>Uncover the Truth:</strong><br>You are a private investigator hired to delve into the mysteries of a gruesome family murder. Little do you know, the answers are hidden within the confines of your own fractured mind.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>alter your surroundings and reveal hidden clues. Piece together the shattered puzzle of your memories, each picture bringing you closer to the disturbing truth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813120/extras/db56a31f0a6ff4a8e8ec58b0fa9b2a89.poster.avif?t=1713210658\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813120/extras/db56a31f0a6ff4a8e8ec58b0fa9b2a89.webm?t=1713210658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813120/extras/db56a31f0a6ff4a8e8ec58b0fa9b2a89.mp4?t=1713210658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore a House of Shadows:</strong><br>Roam through a hauntingly atmospheric house, solve puzzles, and unlock the secrets that lead to a mysterious basement. But beware, not all doors are meant to be opened.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813120/extras/8aab0769d49db0f028be4cb43cbbb79e.poster.avif?t=1713210658\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813120/extras/8aab0769d49db0f028be4cb43cbbb79e.webm?t=1713210658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813120/extras/8aab0769d49db0f028be4cb43cbbb79e.mp4?t=1713210658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Psychological Terrors Await:</strong><br>Immerse yourself in an eerie environment where reality is fluid, and your own sanity is put to the test. Uncover unsettling memories, and face the consequences of a past shrouded in darkness.<br><br>Clandestine is not just a game; it's a descent into the depths of your own subconscious. Are you ready to confront the horrors hidden within? Enter the darkness on Steam and discover the secrets that lie beneath the surface.",
